#: ../../agent_summary/agent_summary.rst:3
msgid "Agent Summary"
msgstr "エージェント概要"

#: ../../agent_summary/agent_summary.rst:5
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you have admin privileges, you can access full agent information via "
"the **Administration** menu. From version 22.09, Backend.AI WebUI also "
"supports displaying partial agent node information for non-admin users "
"when the server configuration allows it. On the **Agent Summary** page, "
"you can view agent information including endpoint address, CPU "
"architecture, resource allocation, and whether the agent is schedulable. "
"This page is useful for checking resource availability before creating a "
"compute session."
msgstr ""
"現在、エージェント情報は管理メニューを通じて管理者ロールを持つユーザーのみが閲覧できます。22.09から、Backend.AI "
"WebUIは、設定がされている場合に、エージェントノードの部分的な情報を表示することをサポートしています。エージェント概要メニューでは、エンドポイントアドレス、CPUアーキテクチャ、リソース使用率、およびエージェントがスケジュール可能かどうかを含むエージェント情報の一覧を確認できます。このメニューはセッション作成時のリソース割り当てを確認するのに役立ちます。"

#: ../../agent_summary/agent_summary.rst:14
msgid "Agent Information"
msgstr ""

#: ../../agent_summary/agent_summary.rst:16
msgid ""
"The agent list displays the following information for each connected "
"agent node:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../agent_summary/agent_summary.rst:18
msgid "**Endpoint**: The network address of the agent node."
msgstr ""

#: ../../agent_summary/agent_summary.rst:19
msgid ""
"**CPU Architecture**: The CPU architecture of the agent (e.g., "
"``x86_64``, ``aarch64``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../agent_summary/agent_summary.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Resource Allocation**: A summary of the resources currently allocated "
"and available on the agent, including CPU, memory, and AI accelerators."
msgstr ""

#: ../../agent_summary/agent_summary.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Schedulable**: Indicates whether the agent is available for scheduling "
"new compute sessions. If the agent is not schedulable, new sessions "
"cannot be placed on it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../agent_summary/agent_summary.rst:24
msgid ""
"Depending on the server configuration, the agent summary feature may not "
"be available. In that case, please contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""

